  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 23 01 05 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}呵呵……\n我们输了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}本以为战斗的尽头，\n会有某种“答案”，\n但此刻，没有任何声音向我诉说……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:0:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}只有无与伦比的充实感……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}是啊……\n这一定就是答案……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 02 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}你们心中，如宝珠般闪耀的光芒……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}那一定是生命的呐喊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}竭尽所有力量，\n拼命挣扎、奋战、苦苦求生……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}那才是所谓的……活着吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 24 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}与各位交手时，\n我们确确实实地活着……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}也许，这就是我们一直寻求的东西。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}……无论如何，\n感谢你们带来这段充实的时光。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}今后，\n我们仍会一如既往地帮助你们。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e824_440.bf.json:5:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}另外，报酬会在保健室交给你们，\n可别忘了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
